*======================================================================
* lin.a99 - a module that does nothing but carry lib/linein.a99, so that the
* tests (tests/test_kernel.py, group linein) can call LINEIN in the simulator.
*======================================================================
       COPY "kernel.equ"
       COPY "macros.a99"

       AORG >C000
       DATA INIT,TICK,INIT,0

INIT   RT
TICK   RT

       COPY "linein.a99"
